TTRS Racing Wheel
=================

An independent reimplementation of the user interface of a Thrustmaster racing
wheel control panel, for Linux. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or
supported by Thrustmaster or Guillemot Corporation.


Trademarks
----------
"Thrustmaster", "TMX", "T150", "T300" and other model names are trademarks of
their respective owners. They appear here only to describe which hardware the
software works with (nominative use). No logos or brand artwork are included.


No vendor files
---------------
This repository contains no original driver binaries, icons, effect presets
(.ffe), installer payloads or any other file extracted from the vendor
package. All artwork in the application is drawn in code; all strings were
written for this project.


Third-party components
----------------------
driver/t150/       hid-t150 kernel module. Separate program, GNU General Public
                   License version 2, by its original authors. It keeps its own
                   licence; see driver/t150/LICENSE.

egui / eframe      GUI toolkit, MIT OR Apache-2.0. Exact versions are pinned in
                   Cargo.lock.

ProtonDB           Compatibility verdicts are requested at runtime from
                   protondb.com. Nothing from it is redistributed here.

DiRT 3 action map  The action-map XML used to make DiRT 3 recognise the wheel
                   comes from a third-party guide and is NOT part of this
                   repository. See the game notes in the application.
